# Place your 15-minute video clips here.
#
# Required naming convention:
#   <segment>_<slot>.mp4
#
# Examples:
#   regional_10am.mp4   (Regional Road, 10 am peak)
#   regional_1pm.mp4    (Regional Road, 1 pm off-peak)
#   regional_5pm.mp4    (Regional Road, 5 pm evening peak)
#   valley_10am.mp4     (Valley Road, 10 am)
#   valley_1pm.mp4
#   valley_5pm.mp4
#
# Supported extensions: .mp4  .avi  .mov